id: pm-lq10y3
title: "GH-1287: Release evidence integration test depends on mutable repository changelog state"
description: Scheduled Auto Release 35702036265 failed coverage because the real tracker integration test requests version 9999.1.1 and relies on an ambient Unreleased section removed during release preparation. Make the fixture own its changelog and release inputs without weakening complete tracker evidence.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-22T09:38:49.636Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-22T12:17:32.406Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-22T10:35:37.303Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-22T10:35:37.303Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: The test passes with versioned-only and unreleased changelogs; isolated fixture inputs retain the real over-budget tracker regression; full coverage passes with release-prepared inputs
parent: pm-e70zh5
resolution: "The integration fixture owns dated-only and Unreleased changelogs, generator location and Git lookup directory while retaining the real over-budget tracker."
expected_result: Release preparation can rewrite the checkout changelog without changing integration-test inputs or dropping release evidence.
actual_result: Both owned changelog variants pass the real 128-item completeness regression and the full coverage suite.
