comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T09:38:49.636Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live 2791-item all-status export and full pm-svxdsx history inspected. The closed item fixed tracker truncation; this distinct escaped test-isolation regression is evidenced by GH-1287 and scheduled run 35702036265."
  "2026-09-22T09:41:44.429Z","harness:codex","Regression proof: the scheduled gate failed before repair with no changelog section for version 9999.1.1. The corrected integration fixture copies the real generator into its owned root and supplies versioned-only and Unreleased changelogs. The real SDK-created 128-item completeness test passes for both inputs without touching the repository changelog."
  "2026-09-22T09:51:39.666Z","harness:codex","GitHub intake 2026-09-22: no open PRs; GH-1287 links to this item and GH-1246 already links to pm-z3ez. Dependabot, code-scanning and secret-scanning APIs return zero open alerts; pnpm audit reports zero known vulnerabilities. Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.18 is installed through its package-owned path. fast-check 4.10.2 and tsx 4.23.15 are within the three-day Dependabot cooldown; TypeScript 7, Vitest 5 and npm-package-arg 14 remain assigned to their existing compatibility migration items."
  "2026-09-22T10:35:35.047Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 9202 tests passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. PM-linked regressions, build, typecheck, source/lint/duplicate/contracts/docs gates, packed npx/bunx, previous-version compatibility and real temporary-project CLI/SDK acceptance passed. The live Sentry/telemetry reliability gate passed. Local cold-start timing failures under host contention are preserved in pm-xjy565; the unchanged hosted static gate must pass before merge. Closure is part of the reviewed delivery; publication and merged-head verification are separate checks."
  "2026-09-22T10:47:18.700Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1288 — implementation, linked evidence, typed relationships and package-generated changelog are reviewed together; merge remains gated on final hosted checks and review resolution."
  "2026-09-22T11:27:40.193Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery landed: PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1288 merged as 2b2d97e75525062f9de781bb0b4b1ea36261fcfd. Final PR head 548e3f5e53c75f59b33b816f1d35a7c80b1b3749 passed all required checks, including exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. CodeRabbit confirmed the child-error lifecycle correction and resolved its only actionable thread; every bot artifact was read and reacted to, with one substantive inline response. Sourcery security review passed. Requested full CodeRabbit re-review and cubic were quota-limited; Greptile supplied no review during the blocking check-watching window. Those unavailable reviews are not approvals. Main CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/35720125474 and every other push workflow passed. Main analyzer provenance passed through the identical reviewed squash tree. Issue closure triggered automatic recovery run 35720126489; publication is still pending and is not implied by these green CI results."
  "2026-09-22T11:32:34.919Z","harness:codex","Post-merge observability at 2026-09-22T11:31Z: required Sentry/telemetry gate passed, with zero blocking Sentry issues over 14 days, 2.02 percent weighted finish-error rate against the maintained 6 percent ceiling, and zero failures missing an error code. Explicit inline telemetry flush drained 1 entry to 0 with queue_progressed=true and queue_empty=true; independent filesystem inspection found 0 physical queue bytes. The production store received 37 starts and 37 finishes during the preceding ten minutes, including current events at 11:30:57Z. The broker queue reported zero ready and zero unacknowledged messages. These are current delivery and freshness observations, not a claim of universal unsampled action correlation."
  "2026-09-22T11:44:35.821Z","harness:codex","Closeout tracker verification: full resolution/history-drift validation returns ok=true; graph-composition passes all ten assertions. The same 170 historical missing-resolution records remain documented residuals, and full health authority is ok with 14 advisory legacy hierarchy findings. No thresholds or historical evidence were fabricated. These checks validate the appended merge and observability evidence; publication remains a separate pending result."
  "2026-09-22T12:01:26.032Z","harness:codex","Same-day safety proof: a disposable clean worktree at reviewed merge 2b2d97e75525062f9de781bb0b4b1ea36261fcfd retained release-relevant changes relative to the previous release and shared the existing v2026.9.22 tag. Running the real release pipeline with --dry-run --json returned ok=true, skipped=true, reason=release_already_cut_today and exactly one tags_today entry v2026.9.22. No commit, tag or publication was created. The sole tag points to fd021ed55d7591f5803ad4414ffe6cacb99e8c69; its analyzer gate independently passed the deterministic version/changelog transform from the reviewed PR tree. Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.18 checks the dated release changelog unchanged."
  "2026-09-22T12:17:32.406Z","harness:codex","Publication verified: automatic issue-recovery https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/35720126489 and exact-tag Release https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/35722348658 both succeeded. All nine Linux/macOS/Windows registry candidate/control jobs passed across npm-local, npm-global and Bun. The Release job passed exact coverage, static gates, Sentry debug-ID injection and sourcemap upload, then published npm 2026.9.22 and accepted installed npm/Bun sessions. GitHub advertised the non-draft stable release at 2026-09-22T12:14:39Z: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/releases/tag/v2026.9.22. npm latest resolves 2026.9.22. Independent node scripts/release/verify-published-release.mjs --version 2026.9.22 passed afterward, exercising npm metadata and npx/bunx CLI and MCP surfaces. The sole immutable daily tag remains fd021ed55d7591f5803ad4414ffe6cacb99e8c69; no manual dispatch or duplicate release was created."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T10:00:55.447Z","harness:codex","Release integration tests must own changelog content and the Git lookup directory, because release preparation legitimately replaces Unreleased with a dated section. A complete tracker fixture alone does not isolate release evidence."
